Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-05T06:38:13-07:00","id":944276,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/942976-it-s-alive-promethean-2e-is-here?p=944203#post944203\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is anyone else having a complete inability to load the pages with the Phosphorum Refinement? I've downloaded the file on different devices now and it's the same problem on all of them.<br /> <br /> Edit: ok, it works in adobe acrobat, but the fact that it's the same pages on my laptop's PDF viewer and in iBooks on my tablet makes me pretty sure there is an underlying file issue anyway.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm having a lot of issues with this file in my usual pdf viewer (Documents By Readdle), which has handled every other white wolf/onyx path pdf with no issues. I'll turn about 3 pages, and the pdf will blur without ever focusing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.the